+# Cognitum C15 T2 P2P — C07 Structural Evidence Bridge
+
+**Research-only checkpoint.** An explicit, Protobuf-native, read-only linkage from
+P2O's structural-hypothesis revisions to C07's typed, revisioned belief-state
+projection. This is an *offline interface* tested with simulated host leases;
+it neither integrates with nor authenticates any installed Lu host.
+
+## Main additions
+
+- `proto/cognitum/spatial/v1/structural_c07_bridge.proto`
+- `cognitum/proto/spatial_structural_c07_bridge_pb2.py`
+- `cognitum/spatial_structural_c07_bridge.py`
+- `tests/test_c15_t2_p2p_c07_bridge.py`
+- `tools/run_c15_p2p_t2_c07_demo.py` (MOCK LEASE DEMO ONLY)
+- `docs/components/spatial/P2P-T2-C07-provenance-bridge.md`
+- `docs/components/spatial/C15-T2-P2P-deferred-validation-backlog-v1.json`
+- `docs/components/spatial/P2P-synthetic-bridge-demo.json`
+- updated schema registry `tools/check_proto_descriptors.py`
+
+## Reproduce after extraction
+
+```
+PYTHONPATH=. python tools/run_c15_p2p_t2_c07_demo.py
+PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest -q tests/test_c15_t2_p2p_c07_bridge.py tests/test_c15_t2_p2o_reconciliation.py tests/test_c07_state_revision.py
+PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest -q tests/test_c07*
+PYTHONPATH=. python -m pytest -q tests/test_c13* tests/test_c14* tests/test_c15*
+PYTHONPATH=. python tools/verify_protobuf_schemas.py --require
+```
+
+No Lu/GitHub edits, no canonical C07 or scene writes, no Windows-native host
+verification, no OWL-2 completeness, no real structural inference benchmark.
+The `P2P_SHA256SUMS.json` hashes all included source files (excluding itself)
+and is an archive integrity manifest, not an authenticated signature.
+Previous milestone manifests, if present, refer only to *their earlier snapshot*.